{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24164","headline":"同诸客题于家公主旧宅 · 白居易","name":"同诸客题于家公主旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平阳旧宅少人游，应是游人到即愁。\n布谷鸟啼桃李院，络丝虫怨凤皇楼。\n台倾滑石犹残砌，帘断珍珠不满钩。\n闻道至今萧史在，髭须雪白向明州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}